      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ROOM TO BREATHE (6) was well supported last time and gave a sight after a strong early split but weakened late to finish a 2.25 lengths fourth (19.51) over 350m at Healesville. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and can bounce back. ESPECIAL HUGO (4) was below best at his last start when 6th at Shepparton following a second place finish (25.49) there two back. Key player if finds best. MONUMENT (1) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and three placings from six starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.29) at Sandown in a Grade 5, finishing fourth and beaten 7 lengths. Looks a key chance on best figures. SALT SPECKLE (8) is a last-start placegetter when at the top of betting - in the mix again.",
